{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいお誕生日おめぺろ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の中田は\n展覧会めぐりしてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番の目当ては"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『PARIS オートクチュール--世界に一つだけの服』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/30/0700675/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真ん中にいるの中田ね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーく見ると\n風で前髪が崩壊してるんだけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッション史とかも\n全然知らない状態で行ったけど\nすごく見ごたえがあった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1着1着本当に美しくて\n本当に可愛くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服に見とれるって\n初めての感覚かもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"展覧会後に\nママが子供の頃に読んだという\n『ハリスおばさんパリへ行く』って本について\n熱弁してたから\n読んでみようかなあと思った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\n展覧会ちょくちょく行くんだけど\nいろんなのがあってそれぞれ面白いねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/30/0700675/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グアムのときの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/30/0700675/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレートブラウニーって名前だったけど\n焼き菓子ってよりは\n濃厚しっとりだし\nチョコでグラサージュされてるし\nザッハトルテとか\nチョコレートケーキを思わせる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半分こして食べたのに\n満足感すごかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがグアム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}